# ─── Machine-specific / secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Holds absolute local paths to the WP install + the PHP/wp-cli phar on this
# machine. Never commit — every teammate's differs. See .claude/CLAUDE.md.
.claude/wp-config.json

# ─── Build ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.vite/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Compiled CSS is committed (production has no build step yet — see
# .claude/ci-cd.md). Sourcemaps are not.
*.map

# ─── OS / editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
*.sublime-*
# .vscode/ is intentionally NOT ignored — shared editor config is useful here.

# ─── WordPress noise that must never land in a theme repo ──────────────────
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.zip
*.tar.gz
